.SH "Detailed Description"
.PP 
generic parts of icon-lists. 

right now only used when compiling with specific parts from evas2.c, should replace gnome-icon-list in the future, however. 
.SH "Typedef Documentation"
.PP 
.SS "typedef struct \fB_icon_el\fP  \fBicon_el\fP"
.PP
an icon-element -- icons may be composed of several of these (image, label, emblems, . 
.PP
..) 
.SH "Enumeration Type Documentation"
.PP 
.SS "enum \fB_icon_state\fP"
.PP
\fBEnumerator: \fP
.in +1c
.TP
\fB\fIIE_ALL \fP\fP
all 
.TP
\fB\fIIE_DK \fP\fP
none 
.TP
\fB\fIIE_DFL \fP\fP
default 
.TP
\fB\fIIE_SEL \fP\fP
selected 
.TP
\fB\fIIE_HI \fP\fP
hilighted (mouse-over) 
.TP
\fB\fIIE_CL \fP\fP
clicked (will turn into selected when button released) 
.TP
\fB\fIIE_KBD \fP\fP
keyboard selection 
.TP
\fB\fIIE_TRO \fP\fP
scrollbars only: trough 
.TP
\fB\fIIE_BAR \fP\fP
scrollbars only: bar 
.TP
\fB\fIIE_ABS \fP\fP
scrollbars only: absolute 
.TP
\fB\fIIE_KEY \fP\fP
tooltips only: key 
.TP
\fB\fIIE_VAL \fP\fP
tooltips only: value 
.TP
\fB\fIIE_ID \fP\fP
tooltips only: group-title 
.TP
\fB\fIIE_THMB \fP\fP
has thumbnail 
