.PP
\fBParameters:\fP
.RS 4
\fIe\fP - the first element to destruct (normally the first element of the icon)
.RE
.PP

.SS "\fBicon\fP* icon_el_dst_by_tag (\fBicon\fP * i, element_tag t)"
